> to </span><span begin="03:09.631" end="03:09.949">do </span><span begin="03:09.949" end="03:10.282">ke </span><span begin="03:10.621" end="03:10.821">ze </span><span begin="03:10.821" end="03:11.156">n </span><span begin="03:11.156" end="03:11.391">shi </span><span begin="03:11.391" end="03:11.500">n </span><span begin="03:11.500" end="03:11.789">ze </span><span begin="03:11.789" end="03:11.906">n </span><span begin="03:11.906" end="03:12.195">re </span><span begin="03:12.195" end="03:12.361">i </span><span begin="03:12.361" end="03:12.611">ko </span><span begin="03:12.611" end="03:12.806">no </span><span begin="03:12.806" end="03:12.921">o </span><span begin="03:12.921" end="03:13.281">mo </span><span begin="03:13.281" end="03:13.583">i </span><span begin="03:13.583" end="03:14.761">yo</span></text><text for="line-623bb2a5-b359-4b3e-acbe-ede55f2d3d8b"><span begin="03:14.981" end="03:15.228">hi </span><span begin="03:15.228" end="03:15.527">bi </span><span begin="03:15.527" end="03:15.889">ke </span><span begin="03:16.070" end="03:16.281">mu </span><span begin="03:16.281" end="03:16.421">ne </span><span begin="03:16.421" end="03:16.801">no </span><span begin="03:16.801" end="03:17.164">ko </span><span begin="03:17.164" end="03:17.521">do </span><span begin="03:17.521" end="03:17.846">u </span><span begin="03:18.021" end="03:18.221">mi </span><span begin="03:18.221" end="03:18.401">ra </span><span begin="03:18.401" end="03:18.548">i </span><span begin="03:18.548" end="03:18.882">no </span><span begin="03:18.882" end="03:19.101">sa </span><span begin="03:19.101" end="03:19.347">ki </span><span begin="03:19.347" end="03:20.908">e </span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-14a5a8c2-06c4-4b6b-9d27-b36fbba862aa">绝对…不会放开</text><text for="line-b16fe73d-968c-4241-aa01-deb8b871f359">这双相牵的手</text><text for="line-8edca53d-17d2-4885-9ef3-9e8b544b81ca">看吧 这样的温暖</text><text for="line-16bbf738-796d-44fd-a2d9-08eab7ec2d37">只有 TA 才能创造出来</text><text for="line-2b8afb25-69d2-4636-b8af-7d46d3b6fa66">复杂的言语什么的不需要</text><text for="line-39e6be06-339c-4bb5-8520-bf81e94e2d3c">此刻 相知的共鸣 Brave minds</text><text for="line-75f19790-fe6e-4a72-a544-308a13f9473f">强烈地充满着</text><text for="line-4ff3874c-0827-4010-a4a9-b27f4e71e1a8">无止境地满溢而出</text><text for="line-d2d73650-0471-409b-89db-b68207ed7a7e">想让灵魂编织在一起</text><text for="line-4ba4f128-0830-4e03-adb1-cce78cb33bc0">100万分的心意…来吧</text><text for="line-1c1565ae-1b2a-4dff-973c-ef39bd0ab5ab">让这股能量飞翔吧</text><text for="line-5895807c-8802-4214-80c1-92e103aa54d6">解放全开！全心全力地冲出去</text><text for="line-b83b3e28-9113-4934-bdbb-9fb75c2bfe8d">除了前进之外 不可能有答案</text><text for="line-9bb3f5ce-126f-4903-90b1-bf231ce1fda7">找到了哟</text><text for="line-2140df90-98ab-48e0-8f07-4e634f46525b">内心的归所</text><text for="line-856e01ba-b7b2-401b-9c69-5fca58fd3c0c">Yes！传递到吧！将这全身心的想法</text><text for="line-805a1458-0e5b-47ed-89c5-791817756a7c">响彻吧！胸中的脉动！向着未来的前方…</text><text for="line-bb7faaa2-a111-4f49-a402-aa20643edd75">坦率地注视…</text><text for="line-7b82ddf2-d23a-46e2-a8be-4b909792e5c3">这样的事情无法做到</text><text for="line-389da740-98b3-4a9c-8bd0-8adc05de3096">藏到口袋里的</text><text for="line-1bb0fc85-3892-4a01-8193-5ef93b0463e8">是像借口一样的笑容</text><text for="line-bc3a3957-e542-4cda-b78a-b8e657c5f777">一步一步地 一点一点地也好</text><text for="line-aca22b68-7ee6-4dcf-91df-a82840db4e1d">Ah 传达吧 相信的明天 Brave song</text><text for="line-db7d5100-3611-4bed-9ef4-046e55d95f39">一定一定会实现的</text><text for="line-197a0dea-3763-4996-8455-e8c0123c9dd4">不可能什么的 才不会存在</text><text for="line-90d1f47b-f066-4c84-a4cc-d78112e72bca">不畏战斗的</text><text for="line-3fc768bb-0df8-44e3-9a98-2c1dc94f6586">强大心情啊…来吧</text><text for="line-cc4cdc1a-4878-42a3-a121-48785d65e65f">注入这份能量</text><text for="line-20513c00-bcdf-433f-a46a-2f4c8e6d05d8">百分百全开！将紧握的梦想展示出来吧</text><text for="line-7c65318b-4ab7-49ee-9934-25eb51bd62e7">因为已经没有时间再流泪了</text><text for="line-fa257e1b-558b-4df3-9631-138bfd39432e">必须守护的事物</text><text for="line-66378081-74df-437c-9d39-b64c558dad24">已经存在于我这里</text><text for="line-25303b2c-0f12-4961-b287-20cfc25f5495">Yes 烧灼吧！让生命之火煌煌燃烧</text><text for="line-01e9c71b-456b-4c95-8431-bbbf7dbc56cb">解放全开！全心全力地冲出去</text><text for="line-d8ec40c3-e254-4c9b-b906-206769ee9a03">除了前进之外 不可能有答案</text><text for="line-58ccdbcb-2626-4582-a250-8f7faad91b1a">找到了哟</text><text for="line-b54149b8-24b9-455f-aa20-8d45faecaf0f">内心的归所</text><text for="line-96696924-d921-4512-af5d-971267af7506">Yes！传递到吧！将这全身心的想法</text><text for="line-623bb2a5-b359-4b3e-acbe-ede55f2d3d8b">响彻吧！胸中的脉动！向着未来的前方…</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:21.433"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-14a5a8c2-06c4-4b6b-9d27-b36fbba862aa" itunes:key="line-14a5a8c2-06c4-4b6b-9d27-b36fbba862aa" begin="00:18.681" end="00:21.558" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:18.681" end="00:19.049" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">絶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:18.681" end="00:18.944">ぜ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:18.944" end="00:19.049">っ</span></span></span><span begin="00:19.049" end="00:19.694" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">対</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:19.049" end="00:19.477">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:19.477" end="00:19.694">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:19.694" end="00:20.164">に</span><span begin="00:20.164" end="00:20.638">…</span><span begin="00:20.638" end="00:20.998" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">離</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:20.638" end="00:20.838">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:20.838" end="00:20.998">な</span></span></span><span begin="00:20.998" end="00:21.198">さ</span><span begin="00:21.198" end="00:21.388">な</span><span begin="00:21.388" end="00:21.500">い</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-b16fe73d-968c-4241-aa0